@startuml
title Class Diagram — Decorator Pattern

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
top to bottom direction

interface "IFacebookFeature<T>" as IFeat {
    + Execute(i_User : User) : T
}
note top of IFeat
  Pattern role: Component
  Shared interface for ConcreteComponent
  and all Decorators
end note

abstract class MaxScorePhotoFeature {
    - r_Service : IFacebookService
    ..
    + MaxScorePhotoFeature(i_Service : IFacebookService)
    + Execute(i_User : User) : Photo
    # {abstract} getScore(i_Photo : Photo) : int
}
note right of MaxScorePhotoFeature
  Pattern role: ConcreteComponent
  Pure algorithm — no error handling,
  no timing. (same for all 5 features)
end note

class MostLikedPhotoFeature {
    + MostLikedPhotoFeature(i_Service : IFacebookService)
    # getScore(i_Photo : Photo) : int
}

class "SafeFeatureDecorator<T>" as SafeDec {
    - r_WrappedFeature : IFacebookFeature<T>
    + HadError : bool <<get>>
    + LastError : string <<get>>
    ..
    + SafeFeatureDecorator(i_Feature : IFacebookFeature<T>)
    + Execute(i_User : User) : T
}
note right of SafeDec
  Pattern role: ConcreteDecorator 1
  Catches Facebook API exceptions —
  returns null instead of crashing.
  Sets HadError / LastError.
end note

class "FeatureTimingDecorator<T>" as TimeDec {
    - r_WrappedFeature : IFacebookFeature<T>
    + LastElapsed : TimeSpan <<get>>
    ..
    + FeatureTimingDecorator(i_Feature : IFacebookFeature<T>)
    + Execute(i_User : User) : T
}
note right of TimeDec
  Pattern role: ConcreteDecorator 2
  Measures execution time with Stopwatch.
  Stores result in LastElapsed.
end note

class FormMain {
    - r_PhotoCreators : Dictionary<string, PhotoFeatureCreator>
    - m_CheckBoxSafeMode : CheckBox
    - m_LabelAnalysisTime : Label
    ..
    - runPhotoAnalysis(i_Creator : PhotoFeatureCreator) : void
    - displayPhotoResult(i_Photo : Photo) : void
}
note top of FormMain
  Pattern role: Client
  SafeFeatureDecorator is always applied.
  Chain: Feature -> SafeDec -> TimingDec
end note

abstract class PhotoFeatureCreator {
    # r_Service : IFacebookService
    ..
    + {abstract} CreateFeature() : IFacebookFeature<Photo>
    + RunAnalysis(i_User : User) : Photo
}

class User <<external>> {
    + Name : string
    + PictureNormalURL : string
}

class Photo <<external>> {
    + PictureNormalURL : string
    + CreatedTime : DateTime
    + LikedBy : FacebookObjectCollection<Like>
    + Comments : FacebookObjectCollection<Comment>
}

IFeat <|.. MaxScorePhotoFeature : implements
IFeat <|.. SafeDec : implements
IFeat <|.. TimeDec : implements
MaxScorePhotoFeature <|-- MostLikedPhotoFeature

SafeDec --> IFeat : r_WrappedFeature <<wraps>>
TimeDec --> IFeat : r_WrappedFeature <<wraps>>

FormMain --> PhotoFeatureCreator : r_PhotoCreators
PhotoFeatureCreator ..> IFeat : CreateFeature() returns
FormMain ..> SafeDec : creates (if safe mode)
FormMain ..> TimeDec : creates (always)
TimeDec ..> User : Execute(User)
TimeDec ..> Photo : returns

@enduml
